sequenceDiagram
    title Checkout
    autonumber
    actor U as Customer
    participant W as Web shop
    participant P as Payments
    U->>+W: Place order
    W->>+P: Charge card
    alt approved
        P-->>-W: OK
        W-->>U: Confirmation
    else declined
        P-->>W: Declined
        W-->>-U: Try another card
    end
    Note over U,W: Receipt is emailed
